# Any .env variant - a dated/suffixed backup carries the same live secrets as
# .env itself (DB password, SOCIAL_TOKEN_KEY), and ".env.bak" alone did not
# cover ".env.bak-2026" or ".env.local".
.env.*
!.env.example
